  "design": {
    "idea": "Boss THE QUEEN IN THE GLASS bounces direct yellow bolts off her mirror pane; defeat her via Blue banks off 3 prism transformers, your mirrored Reflection, and Black-World Moon Pool flips, then read her SE shadow among P3 clones to claim Half-Lantern and Pane Silver Twin.",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Synthesizing every Inverted Palace mechanic \u2014 Blue banking, mirror_avatar reflection strikes, Silver/Black flips, and Shadow-Truth reading \u2014 in a three-phase royal duel.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 130,
    "reward": "palace_cleared+silver_twin+half_lantern_7a",
    "why": "Climactic boss court of The Inverted Palace awarding Half-Lantern #7A and Pane Silver Twin.",
